Nested includes from stdin are resolved relative to the included file.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --denominate --include-total --format json <<'LEDGER'
include parts/*.ledger
LEDGER

========== FILE parts/root.ledger ==========

include nested.ledger

========== FILE parts/nested.ledger ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Stock
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 STOCK 12 SEK

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Stock  10 STOCK {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-100"
  },
  {
    "account": "Assets:Stock",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "120"
  },
  {
    "account": "Total",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "isTotal": true,
    "quantity": "20"
  }
]
